    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Элементарная математика\nФормулы сокращенного умножения\n$(a ± b)^{2} = a^{2} ± 2ab + b^{2}$\n$(a ± b)^{3} = a^{3} ± 3a^{2}b + 3ab^{2} ± b^{3}$\n$a^{2} − b^{2} = (a − b)(a + b)$\n$a^{3} ± b^{3} = (a ± b)(a^{2} ∓ ab + b^{2}$\nCвойства степени\n$a^{n}b^{n} = (ab)^{n}$\n$(a^{m})^{n} = a^{mn}$\n$a^{0} = 1$\n$\\frac{a^{n}}{b^{n}} = (\\frac{a}{b})^{n}$\n$a^{−n} = \\frac{1}{a^{n}}$\n$a^{m}a^{n} = a^{m+n}$\n$a^{n} ÷ a^{m} = a^{n−m}$\n$\\sqrt[n]{a^{m}} = a^{\\frac{m}{n}}$\nCвойства логарифмов\n$a^{log_{a} b} = b$\n$log_{a} a^{b} = b$\n$log_{a} b^{c} = c log_{a} b$\n$log_{a} bc = log_{a} b + log_{a} c$\n$log_{a} \\frac{b}{c} = log_{a} b − log_{a} c$\n$log_{a} b = \\frac{log_{c} b}{log_{c} a}$\n$log_{a^{c}} b = \\frac{1}{c} log_{a} b$\n6",
      "method": "math_layout"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Формулы тригонометрии\n$sin^{2} α + cos^{2} β = 1$\n$ctg α = \\frac{cos α}{sin α}$\n$tg α = \\frac{sin α}{cos α}$\n$cosec α = \\frac{1}{sin α}$\n$sec α = \\frac{1}{cos α}$\n$1 + ctg^{2} α = \\frac{1}{sin^{2} α}$\n$1 + tg^{2} α = \\frac{1}{cos^{2} α}$\n$sin 2α = 2 sin α cos α$\n$cos 2α = cos^{2} α − sin^{2} α$\n$tg 2α = \\frac{2 tg α}{1 − tg^{2} α}$\n$sin^{2} \\frac{α}{2} = \\frac{1 − cos α}{2}$\n$cos^{2} \\frac{α}{2} = \\frac{1 + cos α}{2}$\n$tg \\frac{α}{2} = \\frac{1 − cos α}{sin α} = \\frac{sin α}{1 + cos α}$\n$sin α = \\frac{2tg\\frac{α}{2}}{1 + tg^{2} \\frac{α}{2}}$\n$cos α = \\frac{1 − tg^{2} \\frac{α}{2}}{1 + tg^{2}\\frac{α}{2}}$\n$tg α = \\frac{2 tg \\frac{α}{2}}{1 + tg^{2} \\frac{α}{2}}$\n$ctg α = \\frac{1 − tg^{2} \\frac{α}{2}}{2 tg \\frac{α}{2}}$\n$sin α cos β = \\frac{1}{2}(sin(α + β) + sin(α − β))$\n$cos α cos β = \\frac{1}{2}(cos(α + β) + cos(α − β))$\n$sin α sin β = \\frac{1}{2}(cos(α − β) − cos(α + β))$\n7",
